{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53887","headline":"赠李庠郊居 · 张祜","name":"赠李庠郊居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扬子东湾下板桥，密篱迂巷半通桡。\n霜鸣郭外深秋月，消到门前半夜潮。\n看着竹林成竹笋，别来箕树长新条。\n相逢未语平生意，莫忘倾樽慰寂寥。\n（影宋蜀刻本《张承吉文集》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}